    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ieThe robust 3 bed semi detached home is located in a quiet Cul de sac on the southern edge of Carlow town, with excellent immediate access main road access & close to local schools, SETU campus & all town amenities. Block built 7 offering all modern conveniences it presents generously proportioned accommodation over 2 floors extending to 99m2. Oil fired central heating has been recently upgraded, while solid fuel fireplace compliments comfort. Externally , multi off street parking is located to its front with lawns & select planting , while a secure side gate accesses a large west facing , fully walled rear garden, complete with a generously slabbed patio & garden shed. Presenting an excellent starter home or investment vehicle, viewings are highly recommended & invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.36m x 2.02m\nRecessed uPVC double glazed hall door with glazed panel. Laminate timber floor. Carpeted stairs. W.C. beneath stairs.\n\nW.C. - 1.83m x 0.80m\nCeramic tiled floor. Toilet and sink unit.\n\nLounge - 4.20m x 3.80m\nFeature bay windows to front. Curtains, pole and blinds. Laminate timber floor. Solid fuel fireplace.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 4.25m x 3.37m\nWindow and sliding patio doors to rear. Blinds, curtains and pole. Ceramic tiled floor. Fully fitted solid pipped oak floor and wall units. Part tiled walls. Electric oven, hob and extractor fan. Utility room off.\n\nUtility Room - 2.52m x 1.63m\nWindow to rear. Ceramic tiled floor. Shelving and work tops. Plumbing for utility machines.\n\nLaundry - 3.20m x 2.02m\nWindow to side. Carpets. Hot press off. Attic access hatch.\n\nBathroom - 2.29m x 1.70m\nWindow to rear. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Toilet, sink unit with vanity storage. Bath, corner shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.60m x 3.55m\nDouble room, twin windows to rear. Curtains and poles. Carpets. Built in storage unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.84m x 3.84m\nDouble room, window to front. Carpets, curtains and pole. Built in storage units.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.00m x 2.60m\nSingle room, window to front. Carpets. Curtains and pole.\n\nGarden - \nOpen plan to front. Mature lawns. Off-street parking. Feature side gate and fully walled rear garden. West facing rear aspect. Slabbed patio area. Garden shed. External oil burner.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
